@startuml
title Estimation run control
[*] --> Running : startup (ESTIMATION_AUTOSTART=true)
[*] --> Stopped : startup (ESTIMATION_AUTOSTART=false)
Running --> Stopped : POST /api/estimation/stop\n(last estimate kept, shown frozen)
Stopped --> Running : POST /api/estimation/start\n(new run_id, uses observations from now)
Running --> Running : POST /api/reset\n(scenario restarts from target initial state,\nnew run_id)
Running : estimator processes the observation feed
Stopped : estimator idle; simulation (truth, observers) keeps running
@enduml
